:"/docs/components/toast-25","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#multiple-positions-two-channels","content":"To send some toasts to one corner and others to a different corner,\ncreate a second manager with createToastManager and nest a second\nToastProvider for it. Each provider/manager pair is a separate\nchannel — pick whichever you want at the call site."},"3668":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-26","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#variants","content":"The solid variant (default) fills the toast with the status colour\non a white-on-coloured layout. The subtle variant flips to a white\nsurface with a tinted icon — matches the \"notification\" pattern in the\ndesign system."},"3669":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-27","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#loading","content":"For long-running operations, dispatch a toast with type: 'loading'\nand timeout: 0. Give it a data.cancelProps button, which replaces\nthe close X, so the user can cancel the operation, then update the\ntoast on completion."},"3670":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-28","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#with-icon","content":"Pass any icon node through data.icon; the renderer drops it into\nthe icon slot before the title."},"3671":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-29","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#with-description","content":"Add a second line of context with description."},"3672":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-30","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/toast#with-action","content":"actionProps is forwarded to the action button. Use it for an \"Undo\"\nor other recovery affordance."},"3673":{"id":"/docs/components/toast-31","page_id":"/docs/components/toast","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/