/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-15","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#狀態","content":"狀態"},"342":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-16","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#表單","content":"表單"},"343":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-17","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#圖表","content":"圖表"},"344":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-18","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"Sidebar"},"345":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-19","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#vittal-擴充","content":"Vittal 擴充"},"346":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-20","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#avatar-色盤","content":"Avatar 色盤"},"347":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-21","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#tag-色盤","content":"Tag 色盤"},"348":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-22","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#概覽","content":"Vittal Design 的語意層沿用 shadcn/ui 的命名。顏色定義在 tokens/（Style Dictionary），建置成 src-v2/styles/tokens/generated.css 裡 :root 上的 CSS custom properties，暗色值寫在 .dark，再經 @theme inline（--color-*）交給 Tailwind。"},"349":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-23","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#概覽","content":"Primitive 色階（--primary-50…900、--grayscale-100…900、--grayscale-opacity-100…900、--success-100…900 等）是內部基礎。圖表、插圖，或需要指定某一階色調時再用。Tailwind utility：bg-primary-500、text-grayscale-700。"},"350":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-24","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#概覽","content":"語意 token（--background、--primary、--card、--destructive 等）是公開 API。它們描述用途，並搭配 -foreground，讓表面上的內容看得清楚。Tailwind utility：bg-primary text-primary-foreground。"},"351":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-25","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#概覽","content":"元件 token（--avatar-*-fg、--tag-*-solid）是特定元件使用的封閉色盤。"},"352":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-26","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#dark-mode","content":"在祖先元素加上 class=\"dark\"，通常是 <html>。使用 next-themes 時設定 attribute=\"class\"。theme 不會跟著 prefers-color-scheme 切換。重新安裝 @vital-design/vital-theme，cssVars.dark 才會寫進應用的樣式表。"},"353":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-27","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#dark-mode","content":"這一頁每個色票都列出兩個值：L 是亮色值，D 是暗色值。每一格都畫在該模式的頁面底色上，半透明的顏色會和實際畫面一樣。"},"354":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-28","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#what-changes-under-dark","content":"Primitive 色階的暗色值來自 tokens/dark/colors.json。text-grayscale-opacity-800、bg-primary-500 這類色階 class 會自動切換。"},"355":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-29","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#what-changes-under-dark","content":"引用色階的語意 token 會用暗色色階重算：primary → primary.500、foreground → grayscale-opacity.900、border → grayscale-opacity.200。"},"356":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-30","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#what-changes-under-dark","content":"少數語意 token 有自己的暗色值，寫在 tokens/dark/colors.json：background、card、popover（#232327），以及 input（#444447）。"},"357":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-31","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#what-changes-under-dark","content":"以下維持亮色值： 寫死白色的 *-foreground、下方的 avatar 與 tag 色盤，以及效果頁的陰影與漸層 token。"},"358":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-32","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#what-changes-under-dark","content":".dark 的祖先元素會套用 background 和 foreground，所以放在頁面上的文字會用暗色文字色。它也會設定 color-scheme: dark，讓原生控制項、捲軸和瀏覽器的 focus outline 使用暗色。"},"359":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-33","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"紙面用 bg-background，不要用 bg-white。"},"360":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-34","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"底色在暗色會變淺時（例如 bg-grayscale-700、bg-grayscale-opacity-700），字用 text-background，讓字跟著變深。Tag、Tooltip、solid Toast 都這樣做。"},"361":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-35","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"子元素要淡化父層字色時，用 text-current/90，不要用 text-white/90。"},"362":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-36","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"bg-white 和 text-white 維持白色。只用在必須保持白色的標記（例如開關、滑桿和單選的圓點），以及兩種模式都不變的飽和底色上的字。"},"363":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-37","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"某一階在某個模式對比不足時，用 dark: variant 換另一階。資料表格的選取工具列用的是 text-info-400 dark:text-info-200。"},"364":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-38","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#writing-components-for-both-modes","content":"不要用 bg-[#f8f8f9] 這類任意值寫死顏色，改用最接近的色階。"},"365":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-39","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#primary","content":"主要色是一組藍色，用在可互動的元素、按鈕、焦點狀態與主要操作。"},"366":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-40","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#grayscale","content":"預設灰階完全不透明。表面必須不透明時用它，例如 popover、tooltip、toast、實心 chip。"},"367":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-41","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#grayscale-opacity","content":"這個變體使用 rgba(35, 35, 50, α)，疊在任何背景上都會跟著調。用在 hover 色調、分隔線、停用欄位，以及其他需要半透明的狀態。--grayscale-opacity-900 是唯一的實心 hex。"},"368":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-42","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#success","content":"正向回饋、確認，以及「已儲存」狀態。"},"369":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-43","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#info","content":"資訊訊息與中性狀態。"},"370":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-44","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#warning","content":"提醒。不阻擋操作的輕度警告。"},"371":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-45","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#destructive","content":"錯誤、破壞性動作，以及擋下流程的驗證失敗。"},"372":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-46","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#語意-token","content":"依用途命名的別名，指向 primitive 顏色。每個表面都有配對的 -foreground token。一起用，文字在主題被覆寫時仍然看得清楚。"},"373":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-47","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#表面","content":"頁面外框、card、popover，以及 muted / accent 區域。background 是頁面；card 與 popover 是抬高的容器；muted 與 accent 是淡的背景色調（例如表格斑馬紋、hover）。"},"374":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-48","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#動作","content":"品牌動作表面。primary 是主要行動呼籲；secondary 是另一種按鈕表面。"},"375":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-49","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#狀態","content":"回饋色，並配上前景色，讓內容看得清楚。"},"376":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-50","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#表單","content":"框線、輸入框線條與焦點環。border 是 0.08 的細線，用於分隔線與單邊框，也是沒有指定顏色的 border class 的預設色。border-overlap 是實色，用於會相疊或交叉的邊線，例如群組中的 avatar 外框或樹狀軌道；半透明的線在那裡會變深。input 畫表單欄位的線條；ring 畫焦點外框。"},"377":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-51","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#圖表","content":"資料視覺化的五階色盤。預設依 primary → success → warning → info → destructive 輪替，圖表系列會跟著品牌色，不受主題覆寫影響。"},"378":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-52","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"應用側邊欄的外框 slot（相容 shadcn）。Sidebar primitive 使用 bg-sidebar、text-sidebar-foreground、border-sidebar-border。產品 block 可以覆寫個別 slot（例如 cloud shell 上的 [--sidebar:transparent]）。"},"379":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-53","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors#sidebar","content":"Slot"},"380":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/design-tokens/colors-54","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/desi