s/button#laying-out-the-content","content":"顏色、尺寸、圓角與 hover 狀態由主題決定。用 className 傳這些樣式不會蓋過變體。按鈕為了 hover 疊層設了 overflow-hidden，所以放在按鈕框外的子元素（例如 -top-1 -right-1 的通知徽章）要在按鈕上加 className=\"overflow-visible\"。"},"1104":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"page","content":"Calendar","breadcrumbs":["Docs","元件"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar"},"1105":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-0","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","content":"建立在 react-day-picker 上的日期選擇月曆。支援單選、範圍與多選，並可完整覆寫 classNames 與 components。"},"1106":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-1","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#preview","content":"預覽"},"1107":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-2","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#usage","content":"用法"},"1108":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-3","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#range-selection","content":"範圍選擇"},"1109":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-4","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#disabled-dates","content":"停用日期"},"1110":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-5","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#yearmonth-dropdown-caption","content":"年月下拉標題"},"1111":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-6","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#localization","content":"在地化"},"1112":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar-7","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/calendar#locale","content":"語系"},"1113":{"id":"/z