ls-and-router-links","content":"Labels and Router Links"},"2324":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-9","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#props","content":"Props"},"2325":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-10","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#pagination-paginationcontent-and-paginationitem","content":"Pagination, PaginationContent, and PaginationItem"},"2326":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-11","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"PaginationLink"},"2327":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-12","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#directional-controls","content":"Directional Controls"},"2328":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-13","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationellipsis","content":"PaginationEllipsis"},"2329":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-14","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#data-slots","content":"Data Slots"},"2330":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-15","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#installation","content":"After configuring the registry, install Pagination:"},"2331":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-16","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#installation","content":"The registry also installs the theme, utilities, and the five icons used by Pagination. You do not need to install the full icon set."},"2332":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-17","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#usage","content":"Compose a navigation landmark, a list, and a list item for each control. PaginationLink renders an anchor by default. Set isActive on the current page to add aria-current=\"page\"."},"2333":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-18","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#client-side-pagination","content":"For in-place updates, use render to compose a native button and keep the current page in your own state. Buttons retain their native Enter and Space behaviour. The preview at the top uses this pattern; its Code tab shows the full example."},"2334":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-19","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#client-side-pagination","content":"Pagination does not calculate page ranges, load data, or own a current-page state. Keep the page count, visible page numbers, and data updates together in the consuming screen."},"2335":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-20","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#more-pages","content":"Use PaginationEllipsis for gaps in the visible range. Pass the hidden page numbers and onPageSelect. It renders the same button as the other page controls and opens a menu of those pages. This example keeps the current group of five pages visible. Choosing a page inside that group does not move the group. When ellipses appear on both sides, the first and last page numbers stay in those menus; the icon buttons still jump to those pages. Three-digit page numbers expand to fit."},"2336":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-21","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#more-pages","content":"The preview's Code tab includes its page-range calculation. The calculation stays outside the Pagination primitive."},"2337":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-22","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#first-last-and-disabled-controls","content":"PaginationFirst and PaginationLast follow the same API as PaginationPrevious and PaginationNext. Place each in a PaginationItem."},"2338":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-23","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#first-last-and-disabled-controls","content":"Use disabled to block click and middle-click activation and remove a control from the tab order. A disabled default anchor also loses its href and retains its link semantics with aria-disabled. Setting only aria-disabled forwards that attribute without blocking activation."},"2339":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-24","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#states","content":"With a single page, every directional control is disabled. In a right-to-left layout, the directional icons mirror."},"2340":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-25","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"Directional controls show icons by default. Supply children for a visible label and aria-label to localise the accessible name."},"2341":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-26","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"Compose a router link through render; Pagination keeps link semantics. For example, with Next.js:"},"2342":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-27","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"The single-row table footer is the Table Pagination block. It places these page controls beside a page jump and a rows-per-page select. When the row is too narrow, the jump field and the page-size select hide."},"2343":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-28","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#labels-and-router-links","content":"To build a different footer, combine these parts with Input and Select. Validate page bounds, and update the page when the page size or result count changes in your screen's state."},"2344":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-29","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#pagination-paginationcontent-and-paginationitem","content":"These render nav, ul, and li respectively, forward native props and refs, and accept className. Pagination defaults to aria-label=\"pagination\"; give each navigation landmark a distinct label when a page contains multiple paginators."},"2345":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-30","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Prop"},"2346":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-31","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Type"},"2347":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-32","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Default"},"2348":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-33","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination#paginationlink","content":"Description"},"2349":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination-34","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/components/pagination","ta