uide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#怎麼選選擇器","content":"不要為了拿到按鈕觸發器，把 Select、Combobox 或自訂的 Command 選擇器包進 DropdownMenu。只有彈出列是指令、而不是綁定的值時，才用 DropdownMenu。"},"4339":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-166","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#import","content":"把套件 import 換成本地 import："},"4340":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-167","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#import","content":"複合元件使用具名匯出："},"4341":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-168","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"Button 不再自己管圖示或載入狀態。把圖示與 spinner 放進 children，並標上 data-icon=\"inline-start\" 或 data-icon=\"inline-end\"。"},"4342":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-169","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"isLoading 改成明確的 disabled 按鈕加上 Spinner。\n應用需要共用的 spinner 時，安裝 @vital-design/spinner。"},"4343":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-170","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"只有圖示的按鈕改用 size，不再用空的 children 或 icon prop："},"4344":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-171","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"有文字的按鈕維持 size=\"md\" 或 size=\"lg\"。實心、有文字的按鈕沿用 v0 的間距：圖示那一側是 12px，另一側是 16px。\n如果用過較早的 v1 草稿尺寸名稱，把 medium 改成 md、large 改成 lg、icon-medium 改成 icon-md、icon-large 改成 icon-lg。"},"4345":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-172","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"variant 的 filled 已改名為 default。新的 ghost 是透明、懸停才有背景的按鈕，用在 popover、工具列與分割按鈕的選單裡（Popup Button 用的就是它）。"},"4346":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-173","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#button","content":"theme 仍把 alarm（實心紅色）與 dangerous（白底紅字）分成兩種意圖。alarm 只在 variant=\"default\" 可用。dangerous 在 size=\"md\" 是有框線的，在 size=\"lg\" 是帶陰影浮起的，對應 Figma 的 Outlined 指引。"},"4347":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-174","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#文字輸入的值變更","content":"Input 建在 Base UI 的 input primitive 上。受控更新優先用 onValueChange。只有呼叫端需要 DOM change 事件時才留原生 onChange。"},"4348":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-175","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#無效的表單控制項","content":"v2 表單控制項拿掉了只有 v1 才有的 isError。改在實際的控制項上使用 aria-invalid。"},"4349":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-176","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#無效的表單控制項","content":"使用 Field 時，欄位外層與控制項都要標無效：Field data-invalid 負責標籤與說明文字的樣式，控制項上的 aria-invalid 負責語意與看得見的框線。"},"4350":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-177","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide#switch","content":"Switch 改用 Base UI 的 callback 名稱。把 onChange 換成 onCheckedChange。defaultChecked、name、value、disabled、aria-invalid 這類 root props 會照原樣傳下去。"},"4351":{"id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide-178","page_id":"/zh-tw/docs/getting-started/migration-guide","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-tw